---
// Variant D — Runde stempel/badge-stil med rotation, autentisk håndværker-feel
---

<section class="gd-section">
  <div class="gd-container">
    <div class="gd-head">
      <span class="gd-eyebrow">Fire ting du kan stole på</span>
      <h2 class="gd-h2">Vi <em>stempler ind</em> for det her.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gd-grid">
      <div class="gd-item">
        <div class="gd-stamp gd-rotate-1">
          <div class="gd-stamp-inner">
            <div class="gd-stamp-num">12<span>mio</span></div>
            <div class="gd-stamp-label">Forsikret</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="gd-title">Forsikret op til 12 mio. kr</h3>
        <p class="gd-body">Hos Alm. Brand Forsikring med dækning op til 12.000.000 kroner — så du står ikke alene, hvis noget går galt.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gd-item">
        <div class="gd-stamp gd-rotate-2">
          <div class="gd-stamp-inner">
            <div class="gd-stamp-num">90<span>dage</span></div>
            <div class="gd-stamp-label">Garanteret</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="gd-title">Levering inden 90 dage</h3>
        <p class="gd-body">Mangeårig erfaring gør, at vi kan garantere levering af nyt stråtag indenfor 90 dage fra projektstart.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gd-item">
        <div class="gd-stamp gd-rotate-3">
          <div class="gd-stamp-inner">
            <div class="gd-stamp-num">15<span>+ år</span></div>
            <div class="gd-stamp-label">Erfaring</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="gd-title">15+ års tækkeerfaring</h3>
        <p class="gd-body">Mere end 15 års arbejde med tækkefaget for private kunder på Sjælland. Erfaring giver et tag der holder.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gd-item">
        <div class="gd-stamp gd-rotate-4">
          <div class="gd-stamp-inner">
            <div class="gd-stamp-num">0<span>kr.</span></div>
            <div class="gd-stamp-label">Uforpligtende</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="gd-title">Uforpligtende tilbud</h3>
        <p class="gd-body">Vi udarbejder gerne et tilbud efter at have set taget. Du forpligter dig til ingenting før du har skrevet under.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .gd-section { background: #f4ede2; padding: 96px 0; position: relative; }
  .gd-section::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 5%; right: 5%; height: 1px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(111,67,21,0.4) 0 8px, transparent 8px 16px);
  }
  .gd-container { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  .gd-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 72px; }
  .gd-eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6f4315; display: block; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .gd-h2 { font-family: var(--font-headline); font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); color: #1b1c1c; margin: 0; font-weight: 500; }
  .gd-h2 em { font-style: italic; color: #6f4315; font-weight: 400; }

  .gd-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 56px; }
  .gd-item { text-align: center; }

  .gd-stamp {
    width: 140px; height: 140px; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px double #6f4315;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    color: #6f4315;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(111,67,21,0.1);
  }
  .gd-stamp-inner {
    width: 122px; height: 122px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(111,67,21,0.4);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .gd-stamp-num {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #6f4315;
  }
  .gd-stamp-num span { font-size: 0.85rem; font-style: italic; margin-left: 4px; }
  .gd-stamp-label {
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: #6f4315;
  }
  .gd-rotate-1 { transform: rotate(-6deg); }
  .gd-rotate-2 { transform: rotate(4deg); }
  .gd-rotate-3 { transform: rotate(-3deg); }
  .gd-rotate-4 { transform: rotate(7deg); }

  .gd-title { font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #1b1c1c; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .gd-body { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.65; color: #51443a; margin: 0; max-width: 280px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

  @media (min-width: 768px) { .gd-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 56px 32px; } }
  @media (min-width: 1100px) { .gd-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 32px; } }
</style>
